  "url": "/restaurant-admin/payments",
  "text": "Branch\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nGarden House Flow QA — Main Branch · MAIN\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nDAILY\nToday\nOrders\nMenu\nCustomers & loyalty\nDevices & sync\nOPERATIONS\nKIOSK MANAGEMENT\nQR ORDERING\nREPORTS\nSETUP\nMenu templates\nCustomisations & Tax\nOffers & Coupons\nTeam & permissions\nPayments & Split\nPrinters & Devices\nReceipt & E-Bill\nRestaurant Settings\nSubscription Plans\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nApp Downloads\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLog out\nPayments · selected branch\nGarden House Flow QA · Garden House Flow QA — Main Branch\n\nSettlement changes affect financial records. A payment attempt is separate from confirmed collection; serving an order does not settle its bill.\n\nPayments & Split Tenders Ledger\nMULTI-TENDER AUDIT\n\nBreakdown of Cash, UPI Bharat QR, Card Swipe EDC, and Split-Tender reconciliations across all cashier counters.\n\nGROSS SALES RECEIVED\n₹0\nAll Payment Modes Combined\nCASH IN DRAWER\n₹0\n0% of Total Volume\nUPI / BHARAT QR\n₹0\n0% Digital QR Volume\nCARD SWIPE EDC\n₹0\nBank EDC Settlements\nUnderstanding Split Multi-Tender Payments\n\nHow JAMANVAAR POS handles split payment allocations seamlessly\n\nSmart Settlement Active\n1. FLEXIBLE ALLOCATION\n\nFor any bill (e.g. ₹756), the cashier can allocate part of the amount to Cash (e.g. ₹500) and the remaining balance to UPI QR (e.g. ₹256).\n\n2. EXACT CASH DRAWER MATH\n\nThe Cash portion is strictly recorded in the Cash Drawer Shift Ledger, preventing float discrepancies during end-of-day reconciliation.\n\n3. ITEMIZED TAX RECEIPT\n\nThe printed 80mm/58mm thermal receipt and WhatsApp e-Bill itemize the breakdown clearly: Cash: ₹500 | UPI: ₹256.\n\nCompleted Payment Transactions (0)\nReal-Time Sync\nORDER / INVOICE\tTABLE / TYPE\tCUSTOMER\tTOTAL SETTLED\tPAYMENT METHOD\tTIMESTAMP\tRECEIPT\nJAMAN AI\nDisplay",
